# file count  why the payload's caller recourse cannot reach the user:
# its caller built the input, or the holder never renders the payload's
# text (scripts/gates/spline-refusal-holders.sh; a kernel-built input
# whose text the holder renders is held as geom_core::spline::Built).
crates/geom-core/src/spline/algebra.rs 1 KnotAlgebraError::Structure: the knot API's caller supplied the curve
crates/geom-core/src/spline/compose.rs 1 ComposeError::Structure: the compose API's caller supplied the curve data
crates/geom/src/curves/fit.rs 1 FitError::Structure: the caller asked for degree 0
crates/geom-brep/src/offset_fit.rs 1 OffsetFitError::Fit: renders its own sentence and ending, never the FitError's text
crates/geom-brep/src/ssi.rs 1 SsiError::Fit: renders its own sentence and ending, never the FitError's text
